IFIEDS GROUP, CONTINUING TO MOVE FORWARD WITH HELP OF GOLDMAN SACHS & CO.DEVIN WENIG STEPPING DOWN AS PRESIDENT AND CEO, AND A DIRECTOR OF COMPANY.FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.75 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SAYS DEVIN WENIG STEPPING DOWN AS PRESIDENT AND CEO, AND A DIRECTOR OF COMPANY."}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2019-09-25 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'eBay Inc Appoints Scott Schenkel As Interim Chief Executive Officer', 'text': "EBAY INC. ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP TRANSITION.EBAY INC - SCOTT SCHENKEL APPOINTED INTERIM CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.EBAY INC - EBAY BOARD WILL UNDERTAKE A SEARCH TO IDENTIFY COMPANY'S NEXT CEO, AND WILL CONSIDER INTERNAL AND EXTERNAL CANDIDATES..EBAY INC - EBAY REAFFIRMED ITS FULL YEAR GUIDANCE FOR 2019 OF ORGANIC FX-NEUTRAL REVENUE GROWTH OF 2% TO 3%.EBAY INC - ANDY CRING, EBAY'S VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL FINANCIAL PLANNING AND ANALYSIS, HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO SERVE AS INTERIM CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.EBAY INC - EBAY REAFFIRMED ITS FULL YEAR GUIDANCE FOR 2019 OF NON-GAAP EPS GROWTH OF $2.70 TO $2.75 PER SHARE.EBAY INC - EBAY REAFFIRMED ITS FULL YEAR GUIDANCE FOR 2019 OF GAAP EPS GROWTH OF $1.97 TO $2.07 PER SHARE..EBAY INC - PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED OPERATING REVIEW IS ONGOING, AND COMPANY EXPECTS TO PROVIDE AN UPDATE THIS FALL.EBAY INC - -  STRATEGIC REVIEW OF ASSET PORTFOLIO, INCLUDING STUBHUB & EBAY CLASSIFIEDS GROUP, CONTINUING TO MOVE FORWARD WITH HELP OF GOLDMAN SACHS & CO.EBAY INC - DEVIN WENIG STEPPING DOWN AS PRESIDENT AND CEO, AND A DIRECTOR OF COMPANY.EBAY INC - FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.75 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA."}{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2019-09-25 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alchemy Technology And Equifax Partner To Drive FinTech Innovation', 'text': 'ALCHEMY TECHNOLOGY AND EQUIFAX PARTNER TO DRIVE FINTECH INNOVATION.'}{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2019-09-25 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Freeport-Mcmoran Sets Quarterly Cash Dividend Of $0.05Per Share', 'text': 'SETS QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.05PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'HLT', 'date': '2