OR NOTES OFFERING.QORVO INC -  PROPOSES TO OFFER, $300 MILLION PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR NOTES DUE 2029.'}{'symbol': 'SLB', 'date': '2019-09-25 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Schlumberger Announces Expiration Of Tender Offer', 'text': 'SCHLUMBERGER ANNOUNCES EXPIRATION OF TENDER OFFER FOR ANY AND ALL OF SCHLUMBERGER HOLDINGS CORPORATION’S OUTSTANDING 3.000% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2020 AND 3.625% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2022.'}{'symbol': 'VFC', 'date': '2019-09-25 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'VF Corp Says Intends To Return $10 Bln To Shareholders Through Dividends And Share Repurchases Between Fiscal 2020 And Fiscal 2024', 'text': 'VF CORPORATION UPDATES LONG-TERM STRATEGIC GROWTH PLAN AND INTRODUCES FISCAL 2024 FINANCIAL OUTLOOK.VF CORP - REVENUE THROUGH FISCAL 2024 IS EXPECTED TO GROW AT A FIVE-YEAR COMPOUNDED ANNUAL GROWTH RATE (CAGR) BETWEEN 7 PERCENT AND 8 PERCENT.VF CORP - GROSS MARGIN IS EXPECTED TO EXCEED 55.5 PERCENT IN FISCAL 2024..VF CORP - FISCAL 2024 EARNINGS PER SHARE IS EXPECTED TO GROW AT 5-YEAR CAGR OF BETWEEN 12 PERCENT & 14 PERCENT AS COMPARED TO FISCAL 2019 ADJUSTED EPS.VF CORP - INTENDS TO RETURN $10 BILLION TO SHAREHOLDERS THROUGH DIVIDENDS AND SHARE REPURCHASES BETWEEN FISCAL 2020 AND FISCAL 2024.VF CORP - EXPECTS TO GENERATE ABOUT $8 BILLION OF FREE CASH FLOW ON A CUMULATIVE BASIS BETWEEN FISCAL 2020 & FISCAL 2024.VF CORP - INTRODUCING AN EVOLVED CORPORATE LOGO AND BRANDING.VF CORP -  EXPECTS TO DELIVER ANNUAL TOTAL SHAREHOLDER RETURN IN 14 PERCENT TO 16 PERCENT RANGE TILL FISCAL 2024.'}